Kc5 { How to make progress? } 10. d6 $1 { An ingenious sacrifice in order to enter with the king. } Kxd6 11. Kd4 { Opposition. As we already know, there is a way to put an end to Black's bishop moves, so he is lost. } Bb7 12. Bf1 $1 Bc8 13. Bd3 { White soon wins; } ( { e.g. } 13. Bd3 Ke6 14. Kc5 ) 
 ( { or } 13. Bd3 Kc6 14. Ke5 ) 

